  "autoGen5219": "Fix the 1080P high-resolution screen blur problem on the 4th generation Haswell platform (for example, the high-resolution screen blur may be because the value is not large enough. This patch is a dedicated patch for Haswell core display. It is recommended to use this configuration for 1080P and below screens)",
  "autoGen5220": "Fix the problem of high-resolution screens such as 2K and 4K on the 4th generation Haswell platform (for example, the high-resolution screen may be blurred because the value is not large enough. This patch is a dedicated patch for Haswell core display. It is recommended to use this configuration for 2K and 4k screens)",
